      "review_summary": "The PR adds Gateway `talk.catalog` aliases/config resolution, a shared Android Voice readiness model, per-mode setup gating, realtime close-status preservation, docs, i18n inventory, and focused tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +65, Tests +152, Docs 0, Other +454. Total +671 across 18 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. there is a high-confidence source path: current main uses one status-derived `gatewayReady` value and static Voice Setup rows, while the linked PR proof shows mixed Gateway catalog readiness on an Android emulator. I did not rerun the emulator in this read-only review.",
